cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "siRNA Design Studio"
abstract: >-
  A pipeline for the design and evaluation of small interfering RNA.
  Implements host-specific rule profiles, position-weighted off-target
  analysis with correction for database size, alignment-free conservation
  assessment across pathogen isolates, sensitivity analysis of scoring
  weights, and generation of laboratory-ready oligonucleotide forms
  including C911 specificity controls.
type: software
